uTun third-party software notices
=================================

Third-party components retain their own licenses and copyrights. This file
contains the license texts and source notices for bundled components, including
optional components that may be absent from a particular build. uTun's own
license and the additional permission for Wintun are described in LICENSING.

Keep LICENSE, LICENSING and this file with binary distributions. Source paths
below identify the originals in the uTun source tree; their texts are reproduced
here so binary recipients do not need that tree to read the notices.

When updating bundled dependencies, refresh the corresponding license texts,
source notices and release identifiers in this document. External dependencies
(for example Qt, rlottie, FFmpeg and Android/Maven dependencies) are not vendored
by this source tree; retain their own release notices when shipping them.

Components
----------
1. Opus (including SILK and CELT/KISS FFT)
2. SpeexDSP (including KISS FFT)
3. SoundTouch
4. SQLite
5. DNS resolver by William Ahern
6. BSD radix trees
7. lwIP TCP adaptation
8. miniaudio (including embedded decoders)
9. Silero VAD model
10. ONNX Runtime 1.23.2
11. OpenSSL 3.x
12. ZXing C++ (including librscpp)
13. libzueci 1.0.1 (including UTF-8 decoder by Bjoern Hoehrmann)
14. QHotkey
15. Wintun API header (MIT alternative)
16. Wintun 0.14.1 prebuilt AMD64 DLL
17. dnsmasq 2.93
18. libsodium 1.0.22

